allow setting mac address in the SONIC's startup config (#3336)

fix #3324

it is now possible to set the runtime variables in the sonic's statup
config (config_db.json) to ensure that the mac address generated at
runtime by clab will be used:


```json
{
  "DEVICE_METADATA": {
    "localhost": {
      "mac": "{{ .MacAddress }}"
    }
  }
}
```
